[
    {
        "text": "Crypto is freedom. It was 2019 when I found Binance. I needed to sell Bitcoin for ether and I had issues doing it on other exchanges. I asked a friend on Telegram Group, can you recommend me somewhere else to get this trade done? He was like, you can use Binance. I was like, what? I never heard of Binance. I was working part time and I was saving my money for my university fees. With inflation, the charges and everything started to spike, so my savings was not enough. So that's when I started moving all my funds into crypto. I also started using Binance Earn products, which helps me to earn interest on my assets. That was the main way to hide inflation. When it comes to Binance, it was like a total freedom. I have access to my own money. I have access to do anything with transactions. I can't think of anything more empowering. SA.",
